Review this Go function for coupling problems and tell me how to fix the worst one:

```go
func (r *Repo) Save(order Order, dryRun bool) error {
    if dryRun {
        return validate(order)
    }
    return r.persist(order)
}
```

Callers do `repo.Save(order, true)` in some places and `repo.Save(order, false)` in others.
